# acceptance-criteria

EXPORT TEMPLATE acceptance-criteria:
  ABOUT   the canonical Given/When/Then acceptance-criteria format
  TAGS    #product #planning

  SLOTS:
    context: TEXT  "the precondition or situation"
    action:  TEXT  "the action taken"
    result:  TEXT  "the expected, observable result"
  BODY:
    Given {context}, when {action}, then {result}.
  EXAMPLE:
    Given a card with no priority, when it enters Ready, then it is moved to Needs Clarification.
